                                                "text": "Two grounds are surmised , by opposite parties : a pre-contract with Percy , Earl of Northumberland ; and an adulterous intercourse of Henry , many years preceding , with Anne's sister , Mary Boleyn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33b68378-e586-40ea-ac07-2bb2c774d69c",
